This directory implements a Substrait compliance harness for Spice.ai.

It consumes test suites (TPC-H plans, input CSVs, and expected outputs)
from IBM/substrait-compliance at the tag recorded in pin.toml. Those
suites are fetched at run time and are not vendored here.

