Mode A follows the DataFusion consumer wiring published in
IBM/substrait-compliance `examples/datafusion-rust` on `main` (DataFusion
54.1). The v0.1.1 tag's copy of that example is structural only and pins
DataFusion 35.0; this harness does not vendor that example.
